WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.960
Another Thing Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed To
Do at the SCP Foundation: If a mind-controlling

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.640
SCP is discovered, it is to be turned over
to the proper authorities.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:12.720
It is not to be used to advance himself or
others higher in the Foundation.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.600
Look, we’ve all wanted to be more persuasive
people.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.120
Maybe it’s about getting a new job, or a
raise, or convincing your buddies to see the

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:23.600
movie you want to see at the theater, rather
than the Steven Segal movies they always insist

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.000
on.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.240
But Dr. Bright using mind-controlling SCPs
to help advance himself at the Foundation,

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:33.200
or making Dr. Kondraki pee his pants so that
he can take his projects while Kondraki is

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:38.080
put on mandatory mental health leave, is simply
not acceptable professional conduct.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:41.040
Isn’t Dr. Bright anomalously powerful enough
already?

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:44.880
We really don’t need him gaining the power
to control the human mind.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.720
It just won’t end well.

